{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1062736/block/singleImage/3261667/df/01M4XZ24C1RKSR45YZ2R3MJRJD.jpg?updatedAt=1794192355\"/><figcaption>Anthropic斥資34億美元，為其數據中心購入大型發電機。(資料圖片/路透社)</figcaption></figure><p>據英國《金融時報》報道，美國人工智能（AI）公司Anthropic斥資34億美元（約266億港元），為其數據中心購入大型發電機，是AI實驗室公司迄今為止已知最大的單筆電力設備採購。 報道稱，Anthropic於9月下旬向發電機供應商OnePWR Solutions購買了1.7吉瓦（GW）的重型發電機，而此次採購旨在進一步深入能源產業並繞過中間商，直接獲得電力設備的最新跡象。 彭博分析指，這宗交易也反映出Anthropic因嚴重依賴合作夥伴提供電力、晶片、數據中心和土地，公司正努力加強對AI營運基礎設施的控制。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.583131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T02:45:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:18.053171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:44.906480+00:00","content_hash":"08813acab84be4a03fb73e1898f555391ad846e0582fc245dd1eaa1dba96abca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.583131+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}